    <description>Screen subflow used to ship an asset or retire it during the shipment journey. Captures shipping/retirement details and stamps Status and related dates on the Asset; Asset Assignment creation is delegated to Asset_After_Create_Assignment_on_Status_Change. On Ship, the Asset is updated twice (Status=Shipped with Ship_Date, then Status=Deployed with Deployment_Date = Ship_Date + 2) so Shipped and Deployed assignment records are both created. (INC3-139)

2026-08-12: Ship path now performs a second Asset update to Deployed with Deployment_Date = Ship_Date + 2 so two Asset Assignments are created (INC3-139)</description>
